  fro-usc:hasChapeauText "No law of any State or political subdivision thereof requiring the registration, licensing, or qualification as an investment adviser or supervised person of an investment adviser shall apply to any person—" ;
.
<fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-4-5-7-4-1-6>
