  fro-usc:hasSourceCreditText "( Aug. 22, 1940, ch. 686 , § 12(e), June 25, 1959 , 73 Stat. 143 ; Pub. L. 86–624 , § 7(c), July 12, 1960 , 74 Stat. 412 ; Pub. L. 95–598, title III , § 310(b), Nov. 6, 1978 , 92 Stat. 2676 ; Pub. L. 96–477, title I , § 103, Oct. 21, 1980 , title I, § 6, 54 Stat. 800 , 94 Stat. 2277 ; Pub. L. 100–181, title VI , § 608, Dec. 4, 1987 , 101 Stat. 1261 ; Pub. L. 104–290, title V , §§ 501, 502, Oct. 11, 1996 , 110 Stat. 3444 , 3445; Pub. L. 111–203, title IX , § 939(c), July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1886 ; Proc. No. 2695, eff. July 4, 1946 .) , 11 F.R. 7517, 60 Stat. 1352 ; Pub. L. 86–70" ;
