  fro-usc:hasHeading "References in Text" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0412ab5-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Securities Act of 1933, referred to in subsecs. (b)(5) and (c)(1), is act May 27, 1933, ch. 38, title I , 48 Stat. 74 , as amended, which is classified generally to subchapter I (§ 77a et seq.) of chapter 2A of this title. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 77a of this title and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "The Securities Exchange Act of 1934, referred to in subsecs. (b)(5) and (c)(1), is act June 6, 1934, ch. 404 , 48 Stat. 881 , as amended, which is classified generally to 2B (§ 78a et seq.) of this title. For complete classification of this Act to the Code, see section 78a of this title and Tables." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Words “such Act”, referred to in subsec. (c)(1), mean the Securities Act of 1933 and the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, respectively." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "referencesInText" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1933-05-27/ch38/tI" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1934-06-06/ch404" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/48/74" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/48/881" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s77a" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s78a" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0412ab6-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 1 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-10-9-1> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0412ab6-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1960—Subsec. (e). Pub. L. 86–507 inserted “or by certified mail” after “registered mail”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1970—Subsec. (b)(2). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 3(c)(1), substituted “all investment policies of the registrant” and “which are changeable only if authorized by shareholder vote” for “the policy of the registrant in respect of matters” and “which the registrant deems matters of fundamental policy and elects to treat as such”, respectively. Former provisions are covered in par. (3)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (b)(3) to (5). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 3(c)(2), (3), added par. (3) and redesignated former pars. (3) and (4) as (4) and (5), respectively." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/86/507" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/91/547" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0412ab7-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-10-9-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Effective Date of 1970 Amendment" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0412ab7-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Amendment by Pub. L. 91–547 effective Dec. 14, 1970 , see section 30 of Pub. L. 91–547 , set out as a note under section 80a–52 of this title ." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "effectiveDateOfAmendment" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/91/547" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/91/547/s30" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–52" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toLevel usc-t15-ch2D:idd04d118a-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0412ab8-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-10-9-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Transfer of Functions" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0412ab8-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "For transfer of functions of Securities and Exchange Commission, with certain exceptions, to Chairman of such Commission, see Reorg. Plan No. 10 of 1950, §§ 1, 2, eff. May 24, 1950 , 15 F.R. 3175, 64 Stat. 1265 , set out under section 78d of this title ." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "transferOfFunctions" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/64/1265" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s78d" ;
.
