  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 5 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-2-5> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "provides, in substance, that it may be terminated at any time, without the payment of any penalty, by the board of directors of such registered company or by vote of a majority of the outstanding voting securities of such company on not more than sixty days’ written notice to the investment adviser; and" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437473-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/a/3" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(3)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437474-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 6 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-2-6> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "provides, in substance, for its automatic termination in the event of its assignment." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437474-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/a/4" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(4)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437475-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subsection ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437476-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437477-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Written contract with company for sale by principal underwriter of security of which company is issuer; contents" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437475-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/b" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(b)" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toChapeau <fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-3-17-3-2> ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437476-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-3-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "shall continue in effect for a period more than two years from the date of its execution, only so long as such continuance is specifically approved at least annually by the board of directors or by vote of a majority of the outstanding voting securities of such company; and" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437476-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/b/1" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(1)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437477-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 4 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-3-4> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "provides, in substance, for its automatic termination in the event of its assignment." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437477-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/b/2" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(2)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437478-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subsection ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 4 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-4> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "In addition to the requirements of subsections (a) and (b) of this section, it shall be unlawful for any registered investment company having a board of directors to enter into, renew, or perform any contract or agreement, written or oral, whereby a person undertakes regularly to serve or act as investment adviser of or principal underwriter for such company, unless the terms of such contract or agreement and any renewal thereof have been approved by the vote of a majority of directors, who are not parties to such contract or agreement or interested persons of any such party, cast in person at a meeting called for the purpose of voting on such approval. It shall be the duty of the directors of a registered investment company to request and evaluate, and the duty of an investment adviser to such company to furnish, such information as may reasonably be necessary to evaluate the terms of any contract whereby a person undertakes regularly to serve or act as investment adviser of such company. It shall be unlawful for the directors of a registered investment company, in connection with their evaluation of the terms of any contract whereby a person undertakes regularly to serve or act as investment adviser of such company, to take into account the purchase price or other consideration any person may have paid in connection with a transaction of the type referred to in paragraph (1), (3), or (4) of subsection (f)." ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Approval of contract to undertake service as investment adviser or principal underwriter by majority of noninterested directors" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437478-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/c" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(c)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437479-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subsection ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 5 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-5> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "In the case of a common-law trust of the character described in section 80a–16(c) of this title , either written approval by holders of a majority of the outstanding shares of beneficial interest or the vote of a majority of such outstanding shares cast in person or by proxy at a meeting called for the purpose shall for the purposes of this section be deemed the equivalent of the vote of a majority of the outstanding voting securities, and the provisions of paragraph (42) of section 80a–2(a) of this title as to a majority shall be applicable to the vote cast at such a meeting." ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Equivalent of vote of majority of outstanding voting securities in case of common-law trust" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437479-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/d" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(d)" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–16/c" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–2/a" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747a-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subsection ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 6 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-6> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "Nothing contained in this section shall be deemed to require or contemplate any action by an advisory board of any registered company or by any of the members of such a board." ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Exemption of advisory boards or members from provisions of this section" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747a-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/e" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(e)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747b-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subsection ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747c-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747f-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437482-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:divided_by usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437485-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 7 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Receipt of benefits by investment adviser from sale of securities or other interest in such investment adviser resulting in assignment of investment advisory contract" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747b-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(f)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747c-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747c-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/1" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(1)" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toChapeau <fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-3-17-7-2-1> ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747d-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747e-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747d-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-2-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "for a period of three years after the time of such action, at least 75 per centum of the members of the board of directors of such registered company or such corporate trustee (or successor thereto, by reorganization or otherwise) are not (i) interested persons of the investment adviser of such company or such corporate trustee, or (ii) interested persons of the predecessor investment adviser or such corporate trustee; and" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747d-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/1/A" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(A)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747e-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-2-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "there is not imposed an unfair burden on such company as a result of such transaction or any express or implied terms, conditions, or understandings applicable thereto." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747e-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/1/B" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(B)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043747f-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043747f-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/2" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(2)" ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437480-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437481-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437480-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 1 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-3-1> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "For the purpose of paragraph (1)(A) of this subsection, interested persons of a corporate trustee shall be determined in accordance with section 80a–2(a)(19)(B) of this title : Provided , That no person shall be deemed to be an interested person of a corporate trustee solely by reason of (i) his being a member of its board of directors or advisory board or (ii) his membership in the immediate family of any person specified in clause (i) of this subparagraph." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437480-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/2/A" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(A)" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–2/a/19/B" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437481-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-3-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "For the purpose of paragraph (1)(B) of this subsection, an unfair burden on a registered investment company includes any arrangement, during the two-year period after the date on which any such transaction occurs, whereby the investment adviser or corporate trustee or predecessor or successor investment advisers or corporate trustee or any interested person of any such adviser or any such corporate trustee receives or is entitled to receive any compensation directly or indirectly (i) from any person in connection with the purchase or sale of securities or other property to, from, or on behalf of such company, other than bona fide ordinary compensation as principal underwriter for such company, or (ii) from such company or its security holders for other than bona fide investment advisory or other services." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437481-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/2/B" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(B)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437482-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 4 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-4> ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437482-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/3" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(3)" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toChapeau <fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-3-17-7-4-1> ;
  fro-usc:refers_toContinuation <fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-3-17-7-4-4> ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437483-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437484-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437483-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-4-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "an assignment of an investment advisory contract with a registered investment company results in a successor investment adviser to such company, or if there is a change in control of or identity of a corporate trustee of a registered investment company, and such adviser or trustee is then an investment adviser or corporate trustee with respect to other assets substantially greater in amount than the amount of assets of such company, or" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437483-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/3/A" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(A)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437484-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-4-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "as a result of a merger of, or a sale of substantially all the assets by, a registered investment company with or to another registered investment company with assets substantially greater in amount, a transaction occurs which would be subject to paragraph (1)(A) of this subsection," ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437484-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/3/B" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(B)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437485-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Paragraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 5 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-5> ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437485-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/4" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(4)" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toChapeau <fro-usc-t15-ch2D:r-1-0-4-3-17-7-5-1> ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437486-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  lkif-mereo:component usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437487-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437486-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-5-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "distributed to the public and in which there is, in fact, no change in the identity of the persons who control such investment adviser or corporate trustee, or" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437486-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/4/A" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(A)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437487-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Subparagraph ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 3 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-7-5-3> ;
  fro-usc:hasContentText "transferred to the investment adviser or the corporate trustee, or an affiliated person or persons of such investment adviser or corporate trustee, or is transferred from the investment adviser or corporate trustee to an affiliated person or persons of the investment adviser or corporate trustee: Provided , That (i) each transferee (other than such adviser or trustee) is a natural person and (ii) the transferees (other than such adviser or trustee) owned in the aggregate more than 25 per centum of such voting securities for a period of at least six months prior to such transfer." ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437487-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasIdentifierText "/us/usc/t15/s80a–15/f/4/B" ;
  fro-usc:hasNumberText "(B)" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0437488-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_SourceCredit ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 8 ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0437488-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/act/1940-08-22/ch686" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/100/181/tVI" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/91/547" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/94/29" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/101/1261" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/54/812" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/84/1419" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/89/164" ;
  fro-usc:hasSourceCreditText "( Aug. 22, 1940, ch. 686 ; Pub. L. 94–29 , § 28(1), (2), (4), June 4, 1975 , 89 Stat. 164 , 165; Pub. L. 100–181, title VI , § 611, Dec. 4, 1987 , 101 Stat. 1261 .) , title I, § 15, 54 Stat. 812 ; Pub. L. 91–547 , § 8, Dec. 14, 1970 , 84 Stat. 1419" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd043748a-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 0 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-3-17-9-0> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd043748a-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1970—Subsec. (a). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 8(a), struck out introductory phrase “After one year from the effective date of this subchapter” and “unless in effect prior to March 15, 1940 ,” before “has been approved”, and “by the investment adviser” after “assignment” in item (4), and substituted “It” for “it”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1975—Subsec. (c). Pub. L. 94–29 , § 28(2), inserted provisions making it unlawful for the directors of a registered investment company, in connection with their evaluation of the terms of any contract whereby a person undertakes regularly to serve or act as investment adviser of such company, to take into account the purchase price or other consideration any person may have paid in connection with a transaction of the type referred to in paragraph (1), (3), or (4) of subsec. (f)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1987—Subsec. (d). Pub. L. 100–181 , § 611(1), substituted “paragraph (42)” for “paragraph (40)”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (b). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 8(b), struck out introductory phrase “After one year from the effective date of this subchapter,” and concluding phrase “, unless in effect prior to March 15, 1940 ” after “which contract” before item (1), struck out “by such underwriter” after “assignment” in item (2), and substituted “It” for “it”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (c). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 8(c), made it the duty of the directors of a registered investment company to request and evaluate, and the duty of an investment adviser to such company to furnish, such information as may reasonably be necessary to evaluate the terms of any contract whereby a person undertakes regularly to serve or act as investment adviser of such company, substituted “interested persons” for “affiliated persons”, and struck out “except a written agreement which was in effect prior to March 15, 1940 ,” after “written or oral,”, item (1) designation following “have been approved” and item “or (2) by the vote of a majority of the outstanding voting securities of such company” after “any such party,”, and inserted “the vote” in phrase “by the vote of a majority”, and provision respecting voting “cast in person at a meeting called for the purpose of voting on such approval”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (d). Pub. L. 94–29 , § 28(4), substituted “ section 80a–16(c) of this title ” for “subsection (b) of section 80a–16 of this title ”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (f)(3)(B). Pub. L. 100–181 , § 611(2), substituted a comma for the period at end." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (f). Pub. L. 94–29 , § 28(1), added subsec. (f)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsecs. (d) to (f). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 8(d), redesignated subsecs. (e) and (f) as (d) and (e), respectively, and struck out former subsec. (d) which prohibited any person after March 15, 1945 , from acting as investment adviser to, or principal underwriter for, any registered investment company pursuant to a written contract in effect prior to March 15, 1940 , unless such contract was renewed prior to March 15, 1945 , in such form as to make it comply with subsecs. (a) or (b)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "amendments" ;
