  fro-usc:hasId "idd04d1160-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsection (a), which required the Securities and Exchange Commission to submit an annual report to Congress on the work of the Commission, terminated, effective May 15, 2000 , pursuant to section 3003 of Pub. L. 104–66 , as amended, set out as a note under section 1113 of Title 31 , Money and Finance. See, also, page 191 of House Document No. 103–7." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "codification" ;
