  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1949—Subsec. (b). Act Oct. 28, 1949 , substituted “Classification Act of 1949” for “Classification Act of 1923”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1990—Subsec. (b). Pub. L. 101–550 amended subsec. (b) generally. Prior to amendment, subsec. (b) related to appointment and compensation of employees." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "amendments" ;
