usc-t15-ch2D:idd04f5b55-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 2 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-4-3-6-2> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd04f5b55-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1959—Subsec. (a)(18). Pub. L. 86–70 struck out reference to Alaska." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1960—Subsec. (a)(12). Pub. L. 86–750 , § 1(a), substituted definition of “control” as “the power to exercise a controlling influence over the management or policies of a company, unless such power is solely the result of an official position with such company” for its prior definition which was the same as in the Investment Company Act of 1940." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1966—Subsec. (a)(11)(A). Pub. L. 89–485 substituted “bank holding company as defined in the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956” for “holding company affiliate, as defined in the Banking Act of 1933”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1970—Subsec. (a)(2). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 23(1), substituted “under the authority of the Comptroller of the Currency” for “under section 248(k) of Title 12 ”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1978—Subsec. (a)(5). Pub. L. 95–598 substituted “a case under title 11” for “bankruptcy”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1980—Subsec. (a)(22). Pub. L. 96–477 added par. (22)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1982—Subsec. (a)(18). Pub. L. 97–303 inserted “any put, call, straddle, option, or privilege on any security (including a certificate of deposit) or on any group or index of securities (including any interest therein or based on the value thereof), or any put, call, straddle, option, or privilege entered into on a national securities exchange relating to foreign currency,” after “mineral rights,”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1987—Subsec. (a)(19). Pub. L. 100–181 struck out reference to Canal Zone." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1990—Subsec. (a)(23), (24). Pub. L. 101–550 added pars. (23) and (24)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1996—Subsec. (a). Pub. L. 104–290 , § 303(c)(1), substituted “requires, the following definitions shall apply:” for “requires—” in introductory provisions." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1999—Subsec. (a)(3). Pub. L. 106–102 , § 218, amended par. (3) generally. Prior to amendment, par. (3) read as follows: “ ‘Broker’ means any person engaged in the business of effecting transactions in securities for the account of others, but does not include a bank.”" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "2000—Subsec. (a)(18). Pub. L. 106–554 , § 1(a)(5) [title II, § 209(a)(2)], inserted “security future,” after “treasury stock,”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "2006—Subsec. (a)(2)(A). Pub. L. 109–351 , § 401(b)(1)(A), inserted “or a Federal savings association, as defined in section 1462(5) of title 12 ” after “a banking institution organized under the laws of the United States”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "2010—Subsec. (a)(11)(G), (H). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 409(a), added subpar. (G) and redesignated former subpar. (G) as (H)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Pub. L. 111–203 , § 402(a), added par. (29) defining the term “private fund”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Pub. L. 86–624 struck out reference to Hawaii." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(11)(A). Pub. L. 106–102 , § 217(a), substituted “investment company, except that the term ‘investment adviser’ includes any bank or bank holding company to the extent that such bank or bank holding company serves or acts as an investment adviser to a registered investment company, but if, in the case of a bank, such services or actions are performed through a separately identifiable department or division, the department or division, and not the bank itself, shall be deemed to be the investment adviser” for “investment company”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(11)(F), (G). Pub. L. 109–291 , § 4(b)(3)(B), added subpar. (F) and redesignated former subpar. (F) as (G)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(17) to (21). Pub. L. 91–547 , § 23(2), added par. (17) and redesignated former pars. (17) to (20) as (18) to (21), respectively." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(18). Pub. L. 86–750 , § 1(b), struck out reference to Philippine Islands, which change was previously executed in the codification of this section pursuant to Proc. No. 2695 that granted independence to the Philippine Islands." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(2)(C). Pub. L. 109–351 , § 401(b)(1)(B), inserted “, savings association, as defined in section 1462(4) of title 12 ,” after “other banking institution” and “or savings associations” after “having supervision over banks”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(21). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 986(d), struck out “ ‘Public Utility Holding Company Act of 1935’,” after “ ‘Securities Exchange Act of 1934’,”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(25). Pub. L. 104–290 , § 303(c)(2), added par. (25)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(26). Pub. L. 106–102 , § 217(b), added par. (26)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(27). Pub. L. 106–554 , § 1(a)(5) [title II, § 209(a)(4)], added par. (27)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(28). Pub. L. 109–291 , § 4(b)(3)(A), added par. (28)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(29). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 770, added par. (29) relating to certain terms having the same meanings as in section 1a of title 7 ." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(30). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 402(a), added par. (30)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (a)(7). Pub. L. 106–102 , § 219, amended par. (7) generally. Prior to amendment, par. (7) read as follows: “ ‘Dealer’ means any person regularly engaged in the business of buying and selling securities for his own account, through a broker or otherwise, but does not include a bank, insurance company, or investment company, or any person insofar as he is engaged in investing, reinvesting or trading in securities, or in owning or holding securities, for his own account, either individually or in some fiduciary capacity, but not as a part of a regular business.”" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (c). Pub. L. 106–102 , § 224, added subsec. (c)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/100/181" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/101/550" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/104/290" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/106/102" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/106/554" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/109/291" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/109/351" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/86/624" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/86/70" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/86/750" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/89/485" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/91/547" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/95/598" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/96/477" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/97/303" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t12/s1462/4" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t12/s1462/5" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t12/s248/k" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t7/s1a" ;
