  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/stat/89/169" ;
  fro-usc:hasSourceCreditText "( Aug. 22, 1940, ch. 686 ; Pub. L. 94–29 , § 29(5), June 4, 1975 , 89 Stat. 169 ; Pub. L. 109–290 , § 7(a), Sept. 29, 2006 , 120 Stat. 1321 ; Pub. L. 111–203, title IV , § 404, title IX, § 929Q(b), July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1571 , 1866.) , title II, § 204, 54 Stat. 852 ; Pub. L. 86–750 , § 6, Sept. 13, 1960 , 74 Stat. 886" ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0568718-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 0 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-4-6-8-0> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0568718-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1960— Pub. L. 86–750 substituted provisions requiring investment advisers who make business use of the mails or any instrument of interstate commerce, unless exempted from registration by section 80b–3(b) of this title , to keep and preserve accounts, correspondence, memorandums, papers, books, and records, and make such reports as the Commission requires by its rules and regulations, and that these accounts, correspondence, memorandums, papers, books and rec­ords shall be subject to examination by representatives of the Commission, for provisions requiring investment advisers registered under section 80b–3 of this title to file annual and special reports in such form as the Commission prescribed by its rules and regulations to keep current the information contained in the registration application." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "1975— Pub. L. 94–29 substituted “make and keep for prescribed periods such records (as defined in section 78c(a)(37) of this title ), furnish such copies thereof, and make and disseminate such reports as the Commission, by rule, may prescribe as necessary or appropriate in the public interest or for the protection of investors. All records (as so defined) of such investment advisers are subject at any time, or from time to time, to such reasonable periodic, special, or other examinations by representatives of the Commission as the Commission deems necessary or appropriate in the public interest or for the protection of investors” for “make, keep, and preserve for such periods, such accounts, correspondence, memorandums, papers, books, and other records, and make such reports, as the Commission by its rules and regulations may prescribe as necessary or appropriate in the public interest or for the protection of investors. Such accounts, correspondence, memorandums, papers, books, and other records shall be subject at any time or from time to time to such reasonable periodic, special, or other examinations by examiners or other representatives of the Commission as the Commission may deem necessary or appropriate in the public interest or for the protection of investors”." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "2006— Pub. L. 109–290 designated existing provisions as subsec. (a), inserted heading, and added subsecs. (b) and (c)." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "2010—Subsecs. (b), (c). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 404, added subsec. (b) and redesignated former subsec. (b) as (c). Former subsec. (c) redesignated (d) relating to access to disciplinary and other information." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Pub. L. 111–203 , § 404(1), redesignated subsec. (c) as (d) relating to access to disciplinary and other information." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Subsec. (d). Pub. L. 111–203 , § 929Q(b), added subsec. (d) relating to records of persons with custody or use." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "amendments" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/109/290" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/86/750" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/94/29" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s78c/a/37" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80b–3" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80b–3/b" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toLevel usc-t15-ch2D:idd04f5b5e-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
  fro-usc:refers_toLevel usc-t15-ch2D:idd04f5b60-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
usc-t15-ch2D:idd0568719-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9
  rdf:type fro-usc:USC_Note ;
  fro-leg-ref:hasSequenceNumber 1 ;
  fro-ref:hasSourceInstance <http://finregont.com/fro/usc/USC-2015-title15-chapter2D.ttl#r-1-0-4-4-6-8-1> ;
  fro-usc:hasHeading "Effective Date of 2010 Amendment" ;
  fro-usc:hasId "idd0568719-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Amendment by section 404 of Pub. L. 111–203 effective 1 year after July 21, 2010 , except that any investment adviser may, at the discretion of the investment adviser, register with the Commission under the Investment Advisers Act of 1940 during that 1-year period, subject to the rules of the Commission, and except as otherwise provided, see section 419 of Pub. L. 111–203 , set out as a note under section 80b–2 of this title ." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Amendment by section 929Q(b) of Pub. L. 111–203 effective 1 day after July 21, 2010 , except as otherwise provided, see section 4 of Pub. L. 111–203 , set out as an Effective Date note under section 5301 of Title 12 , Banks and Banking." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "effectiveDateOfAmendment" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203/s4" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203/s404" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203/s419" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/pl/111/203/s929Q/b" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t12/s5301" ;
  fro-usc:hasReferenceText "/us/usc/t15/s80b–2" ;
  fro-usc:refers_toLevel usc-t15-ch2D:idd04f5b21-0c74-11e6-aa53-e455a13f2ad9 ;
.
