  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Amendment by Pub. L. 101–429 effective Oct. 15, 1990 , with provisions relating to civil penalties and accounting and disgorgement, see section 1(c)(1), (2) of Pub. L. 101–429 , set out in a note under section 77g of this title ." ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteTopic "effectiveDateOfAmendment" ;
