  fro-usc:hasNoteText "Pub. L. 111–203, title IX , § 919B, July 21, 2010 , 124 Stat. 1838 , provided that:" ;
  fro-usc:hasNoteText "[For definitions of terms used in section 919B of Pub. L. 111–203 , set out above, see section 5301 of Title 12 , Banks and Banking.]" ;
